1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,525
The Moon is constantly falling toward Earth, pulled by gravity.

2
00:00:04,475 --> 00:00:06,712
But it never crashes!

3
00:00:06,712 --> 00:00:11,225
Because the Moon also flies forward at one kilometer per second.

4
00:00:11,225 --> 00:00:14,675
As it falls, Earth curves away beneath it.

5
00:00:14,675 --> 00:00:20,862
Newton proved this: the Moon is in perpetual orbit, forever falling and forever missing!

